            "objective": "Find a path that leads out",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "701121",
            "objective": "Find a path that leads out",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "70112101",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "Kresnik Kristall located. Please collect at your earliest convenience."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112102",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "The recent construct you built provides highly efficient heating by utilizing the unique properties of Kresnik Kristall."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112103",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "Unfortunately, Prime Ice Constructs have a very short lifespan and cannot be stabilized during the development period. Hence, the authorization to use Kresnik Kristall was granted."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112104",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "...That said, I have already forgotten what warmth feels like."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112105",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Maybe when you get your body back..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112106",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "Yes. Perhaps then, we can warm ourselves by the fireside together."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112107",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "70112108",
                    "speaker": "Eye of Graeae",
                    "text": "But for now, all you need to remember is this: If you collect Kresnik Kristall, I can extract the energy within and use it to maintain your body's surface temperature."
                }
            ]
        },
